<title>JAPAN: Seiyu Ltd depressed by earnings forecast.</title>
<headline>Seiyu Ltd depressed by earnings forecast.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seiyu Ltd shares slipped in early Monday morning trade, depressed by a downward revision in its earnings forecast it announced on Friday, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0030 GMT, the shares were down 30 yen at 1,010.  </p>
<p>Seiyu said that it expected its parent current profit for the year to February 28 to decline to 8.50 billion yen from a previous forecast of 11.70 billion yen.</p>
